  "source_review": {
    "problem": "Each Native fixture executable links empty and GPIO generated binding objects. The obsolete explicit kinds list omitted RTC/LPTIM, leaving four duplicate public factory exports in each executable.",
    "minimal_scope": "Only tests/google/physical_platform_factory.cmake changes. Removes the duplicated hard-coded kinds list and derives names from the actual generated nexus_factory.h for empty OBJECT PRIVATE compile definitions. GPIO OBJECT/export names and production factory emission remain unchanged.",
    "exact_function_recognition": "The narrow canonical pattern requires const nx_<type>_t* followed by a lowercase nx_factory_<name> and literal opening parenthesis. It ends at the parenthesis, so multiline argument declarations remain supported and semicolons in later declarations cannot split a match. nx_factory_io_capability_t is a return type without the required following parenthesis and is not renamed.",
    "observed_names": {
      "stm32": 52,
      "gd32": 52,
      "included": [
        "nx_factory_rtc",
        "nx_factory_rtc_capability",
        "nx_factory_lptim",
        "nx_factory_lptim_capability"
      ],
      "type_not_renamed": "nx_factory_io_capability_t"
    },
    "fail_closed_source_checks": [
      "Unreadable/missing generated header fails the CMake file(READ).",
      "No recognized function declarations explicitly produces FATAL_ERROR.",
      "A recognizable factory call/declaration token with noncanonical return spelling, capitalization or spacing increases the broad reference count without the narrow declaration count and produces FATAL_ERROR.",
      "Duplicate recognized declarations are deduplicated only for identical macro definitions; declaration/reference counting happens first."
    ],
    "parser_scope_limit": "This is a lexical consistency guard for the maintained generator output, not a general C parser or a validation boundary for arbitrary adversarial headers. Malformed-header/empty-header paths were inspected statically; this review did not execute mutation tests or CMake.",
    "namespace": "For each exact symbol, nx_ becomes nx_empty_. Definitions are PRIVATE to the empty object. Existing _init/_fini and nx_platform_{start,stop,*_diagnosed} namespace rules are byte-preserved. No new production API, runtime dispatch, provider state, registry, allocation or lifecycle behavior.",
